exports[`CrewON resource catalog MVP > snapshots employee, skill, service, and knowledge cards 1`] = `"<section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-filter-scope="" data-od-id="shell-view-agents" data-shell-view="agents"><div class="page-stack" data-filter-scope=""><header class="catalog-market-header" data-od-id="agents-header-inline"><div class="catalog-mode-tabs" role="group" aria-label="能力分类筛选"><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter-group="category" data-filter="employee" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-bot" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg><span>员工</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter-group="category" data-filter="skill" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"></path></svg><span>技能</span></button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip mode-tab" data-filter-group="category" data-filter="service" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg><span>服务</span></button></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索能力"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索员工、技能或服务" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button primary compact" type="button">新建个人能力</button><button class="button compact" type="button">更新目录</button></div></header><section class="catalog-source-bar" data-od-id="agent-filters-inline"><div class="catalog-source-tabs" role="group" aria-label="来源筛选"><button aria-pressed="true" class="filter-chip source-tab active" data-filter-group="source" data-filter="personal" type="button">个人能力</button><button aria-pressed="false" class="filter-chip source-tab" data-filter-group="source" data-filter="market" type="button">市场</button></div></section><section class="capability-catalog" data-od-id="agent-capability-catalog"><article class="catalog-card employee-card" data-card-filter="employee personal" data-od-id="catalog-agent-12"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">A</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>员工</span><strong>授信业务智能客服</strong></div><p>回答企业授信业务问题</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>admin</span><span>deepseek-chat</span><span>可调用</span></div></div><div class="catalog-card-actions"><button class="button compact" type="button">查看</button><button class="button compact" type="button">下载</button></div></article><article class="catalog-card service-card" data-card-filter="service personal" data-od-id="catalog-mcp-31"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true">M</div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>服务</span><strong>风控服务</strong></div><p>查询风险信号</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>admin</span><span>3 工具</span><span>已连接</span></div></div><div class="catalog-card-actions"><button class="button compact" type="button">查看</button><button class="button compact" type="button">下载</button></div></article><div class="filter-empty-state" data-filter-empty="" hidden="">没有匹配项</div></section></div></section><section class="shell-view shell-page-view active" data-shell-view="knowledge"><div class="page-stack"><header class="catalog-market-header"><div><span class="catalog-context-note">完整同步 · 文档与分块可查看和下载</span><h2>知识库</h2></div><div class="catalog-header-actions"><label class="catalog-search" aria-label="搜索知识库"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg><input placeholder="搜索知识库名称或描述" type="search" value=""/></label><button class="button compact" type="button">更新目录</button></div></header><section class="capability-catalog knowledge-catalog"><article class="catalog-card knowledge-card" data-card-filter="knowledge personal" data-od-id="catalog-knowledge-41"><div class="catalog-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg></div><div class="catalog-card-body"><div class="catalog-card-head"><span>知识库</span><strong>企业授信风控</strong></div><p>授信规则、材料与常见问答</p><div class="catalog-meta"><span>admin</span><span>8 文档</span><span>126 分块</span></div></div><div class="catalog-card-actions"><button class="button compact" type="button">查看</button><button class="button compact" type="button">下载</button></div></article><div class="filter-empty-state" hidden="">没有匹配的知识库</div></section></div></section>"`;

exports[`CrewON resource catalog MVP > snapshots the agent-platform login and registration entry 1`] = `"<main class="crewon-auth-shell"><section class="crewon-auth-story" aria-label="CrewON 产品介绍"><a class="crewon-auth-brand" href="#"><span class="crewon-auth-brand-mark">C</span><span><strong>CrewON</strong><small>Agent command workspace</small></span></a><div class="crewon-auth-story-copy"><span class="crewon-auth-kicker">YOUR AGENT TEAM, READY TO WORK</span><h1>今天，想让你的 Agent 小队完成什么？</h1><p>像安排真实团队一样描述目标，CrewON 会组合员工、技能、服务和知识， 把任务推进到可交付结果。</p><div class="crewon-auth-task-preview" aria-hidden="true"><span>例如：分析本周项目风险，整理负责人和下一步，并沉淀到知识库</span><b>↑</b></div><div class="crewon-auth-scenarios" aria-hidden="true"><span>整理今日事项</span><span>执行代码审查</span><span>生成交付方案</span><span>检索企业知识</span></div><div class="crewon-auth-proof"><span>Agent 员工</span><span>Skill 技能</span><span>MCP 服务</span><span>完整知识库</span></div></div><p class="crewon-auth-story-foot"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>账号、权限与资源目录统一来自 agent-platform</p></section><section class="crewon-auth-panel" aria-label="账号登录注册"><div class="crewon-auth-card"><header><span class="crewon-auth-mobile-brand">CrewON</span><h2>进入 CrewON</h2><p>登录后继续进入智能体工作台</p></header><div class="crewon-auth-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="登录或注册"><button aria-selected="true" class="active" role="tab" type="button">登录</button><button aria-selected="false" role="tab" type="button">注册</button></div><form class="crewon-auth-form"><label><span>用户名</span><input autoComplete="username" minLength="3" required="" name="username"/></label><label><span>密码</span><input autoComplete="current-password" minLength="8" type="password" required="" name="password"/></label><button class="crewon-auth-submit" type="submit"><span>进入 CrewON</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></button></form><div class="crewon-auth-divider"><span>企业单点登录</span></div><button class="crewon-auth-sso" type="button"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z"></path><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"></path><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M10 6h4"></path><path d="M10 10h4"></path><path d="M10 14h4"></path><path d="M10 18h4"></path></svg>使用企业微信登录</button><footer>登录即表示同意企业账号与资源访问策略</footer></div></section></main>"`;
